[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0010","text":"（又是那群家伙擅自乱来……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0020","text":"（搞什么啊真是……！\n　冬优做了什么吗……！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0030","text":"（啧，这种组合……！\n　……这种组合────！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0040","text":"（──────等等）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0050","text":"（……太热血上头了，冷静一点）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0060","text":"（因为那群家伙的事，\n　让冬优变得不可爱了那才叫最糟糕呢）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0070","text":"──……冬优没问题的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0080","text":"（──看，多可爱）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0090","text":"——好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0100","text":"得快点回到那两个人身边才行♡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
